# dependencies.lock IS tracked, deliberately. It was listed here before there
# were any dependencies. Now there are two, and they are the host side of a
# radio link whose far end is firmware already flashed on a companion chip --
# which is exactly the case where a resolve picking up a newer version on
# somebody else's clone is a protocol mismatch rather than an upgrade.

